{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":446986,\"title\":\"Грибок-теремок\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A mushroom offers the animals of the forest, an ant, a butterfly and a mouse shelter from the storm. A little rabbit, who wants to hide from the fox, also finds a place with him. The mushroom grows, stretches and stretches as it sees the good will of the other animals to help the hare.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1MyB2EAoT1y4IS53wmNeyeZzWEw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7WaPj7fkweTnCODdkdnpIJn2775.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":3,\"year\":1958,\"runtime\":10,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"SU\",\"name\":\"Soviet Union\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Vladimir Polkovnikov\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":588107,\"name\":\"Vladimir Polkovnikov\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/asdXtsqRQcLD01f80yUiOGSfLwU.jpg\"},{\"id\":4512127,\"name\":\"Galina Govorukhina\",\"character\":\"Mouse (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sSzonOwDGGIsCXyGNdjFIuaPOso.jpg\"},{\"id\":2261737,\"name\":\"Zinaida Bokareva\",\"character\":\"Hare (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sagAUUN3YZg0CV9M3HYzoea0a0O.jpg\"},{\"id\":1176663,\"name\":\"Irina Pototskaya\",\"character\":\"Ant (Voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wj9AybiF5UUg2QJjWqQ5hiU68jC.jpg\"},{\"id\":1548413,\"name\":\"Agar Vlasova\",\"character\":\"Sparrow (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7aY4pK1c0CLCeh9ae2lTU0R4BVB.jpg\"},{\"id\":1298527,\"name\":\"Elena Ponsova\",\"character\":\"Fox (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2SSX0q5s7Exb2ejWR3Jf14getT.jpg\"},{\"id\":1841038,\"name\":\"Galina Novozhilova\",\"character\":\"Butterfly (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4lqqmn9fIQ1IVo7WUR8RiQK3YgC.jpg\"},{\"id\":1176662,\"name\":\"Leonid Pirogov\",\"character\":\"Mushroom (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zoNSJvRDnA3Xf0FCkl05JTcIAZS.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":995133,\"title\":\"The Boy, the Mole, the Fox and the Horse\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wAKBWRhMmBtrCCuqmFwPm2RGTph.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wO0MIGcA7w7tBI9Ey80Q4Z7qnPm.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The unlikely friendship of a boy, a mole, a fox and a horse traveling together in the boy's search for home.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":79218,\"title\":\"Ice Age: A Mammoth Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ue5417HaDcvgMDusryenwwwZARq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fHGrJK08XuVlfiCaUkWYOn3L7QA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Sid accidentally destroys Manny's heirloom Christmas rock and ends up on Santa's naughty list, he leads a hilarious quest to the North Pole to make things right and ends up making things much worse. Now it's up to Manny and his prehistoric posse to band together and save Christmas for the entire world!\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13394,\"title\":\"Shrek the Halls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nBfeTZ5ftAbkZXCnGMaCsiA3vOa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5lUaKCo9ypmXbuVeZqKQ9gm8zk4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Christmas tree isn't the only thing green in this new holiday classic. Shrek is back and trying to get into the spirit of the season. After promising Fiona and the kids a Christmas they'll remember, he is forced to take a crash course in the holiday. But just when he thinks he has everything for their quiet family Christmas just right, there is a knock at the door.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":638507,\"title\":\"How to Train Your Dragon: Homecoming\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kXj2Qrfm994yLeuADqbOieU1mUH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lI2AHx0QQrNnEkUqUG01QHUdLDW.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It's been ten years since the dragons moved to the Hidden World, and even though Toothless doesn't live in New Berk anymore, Hiccup continues the holiday traditions he once shared with his best friend. But the Vikings of New Berk were beginning to forget about their friendship with dragons. Hiccup, Astrid, and Gobber know just what to do to keep the dragons in the villagers' hearts. And across the sea, the dragons have a plan of their own...\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":82881,\"title\":\"Tangled Ever After\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5IeMW79OxftIUoR5duxyQ4LW5Iy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6qvKbLYkfXXKM82M38UmDz3IfBk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The kingdom is in a festive mood as everyone gathers for the royal wedding of Rapunzel and Flynn. However, when Pascal and Maximus, as flower chameleon and ring bearer, respectively, lose the gold bands, a frenzied search and recovery mission gets underway. As the desperate duo tries to find the rings before anyone discovers that they’re missing, they leave behind a trail of comical chaos that includes flying lanterns, a flock of doves, a wine barrel barricade and a very sticky finale. Will Maximus and Pascal save the day and make it to the church in time? And will they ever get Flynn’s nose right?\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":460793,\"title\":\"Olaf's Frozen Adventure\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/As8WTtxXs9e3cBit3ztTf7zoRmm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/64Rw7FFXTzx59qlugqxPB6YctFD.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Olaf is on a mission to harness the best holiday traditions for Anna, Elsa, and Kristoff.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":15854,\"title\":\"Kung Fu Panda: Secrets of the Furious Five\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3HENPRM1tGRswyjgiIbP9b4sult.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iezp56ettTUsHWgBjkqvEps5oxc.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ordered to teach a martial arts class of rambunctious bunny kittens, Po tells stories of each of the Furious Five's pasts.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":326359,\"title\":\"Frozen Fever\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mPrDJ7puYzPLG5kPM96iNszF2sM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tQNop6scGYjapYo8j4wCSoVls0i.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On Anna's birthday, Elsa and Kristoff are determined to give her the best celebration ever, but Elsa's icy powers may put more than just the party at risk.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1139087,\"title\":\"Once Upon a Studio\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aiy3G1cYWV3LgKZHY6a3jL8bjYL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8KJMOKyl9rpgb9ELEwhfBMIaTHw.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Created for Disney's 100th anniversary, the short features Mickey Mouse corralling a gallery of legendary Disney characters for a group photo.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1371727,\"title\":\"Sing: Thriller\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g0PZr8TYqIhSWq1EPmTisIqfr0K.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Rhs8yzMTtAcOUvJXqUg7kzljb7.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Buster Moon dreams up a star-studded spectacle set to Michael Jackson's \\\"Thriller\\\" in this animated short featuring characters from the hit \\\"Sing\\\" films.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":47626,\"title\":\"Legend of the BoneKnapper Dragon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/74OqO31AaubZGgreiHIomFyOXUx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vkBMhUSaDUk3JUCS2VUk160IXMM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Hiccup and friends accompany their mentor, Gobber, on a quest to kill the legendary Boneknapper Dragon.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":256835,\"title\":\"Toy Story That Time Forgot\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kVOaFo8RaYQceHfTqbZGmV9R80q.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4vetbabOgDQzpitnAkEVRiZP4P5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a post-Christmas play date, the gang find themselves in uncharted territory when the coolest set of action figures ever turn out to be dangerously delusional. It's all up to Trixie, the triceratops, if the gang hopes to return to Bonnie's room in this Toy Story That Time Forgot.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"wJC5Vedv4SE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"G_CL9LxvMUE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"o2VWz-QaXjs\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}